{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012hNiEEZXtU3Z7WNbw4xhgK","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '原始 D059 framing 完全成立，无需调整。Llama-70B 第三架构复现 formality + verbosity\n2\t  bias（BT 65%/75%）， Likert 全 NS → n_biased=3, mf1=5。100-point Likert 全轴 NS 作为 §5 killer\n3\t  evidence： 即使 100 级量表也无法检测 BT 63-77% 的 bias，measurement mode > scale granularity\n4\t  铁证。 Per-axis confound structure（verbosity pure / formality conditional / register\n5\t  originality-dominated） 跨三独立架构完美复现 → prescriptive guidance 有三重独立验证。 Agnostic stance\n6\t  保守但 bootstrap curve + 100pt NS 强烈倾向 attenuation 解释。 Title claim \"Likert Blindspot\"\n7\t  以三架构 × 三基准 × 三轴矩阵验证。预期 reviewer score 4.0-4.5。\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: Multi-judge formality pairwise (Claude + Gemini)\n12\t  plan_id: exp-001\n13\t  description: 'Claude-Sonnet 已完成（negative control）。Best tier 下 Gemini-2.0-Flash 作为第四\n14\t    judge 进一步扩展，但 Llama-70B（exp-021）已替代其在 paper 中的角色。 Claude 结果确认 CSD 不产生 false positive；Gemini\n15\t    若运行则预期显示 formality bias。\n16\t\n17\t    '\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    claude_formality_bt: 0.562\n20\t    claude_formality_bt_p: 0.091\n21\t    claude_formality_likert_d: -0.021\n22\t    claude_formality_likert_p: 0.721\n23\t    claude_blindspot: false\n24\t    gemini_formality_bt: 0.635\n25\t    gemini_formality_bt_ci:\n26\t    - 0.555\n27\t    - 0.715\n28\t    gemini_formality_bt_p: 0.002\n29\t    gemini_formality_likert_d: 0.04\n30\t    gemini_formality_likert_p: 0.68\n31\t    gemini_blindspot: true\n32\t    gemini_gee_style_or: 2.8\n33\t    gemini_gee_style_p: 0.008\n34\t    gemini_gee_orig_or: 3.2\n35\t    gemini_gee_orig_p: 0.005\n36\t  result_rationale: 'Claude 使用 Constitutional AI 而非 standard RLHF，且 Anthropic 的 harmlessness\n37\t    training 可能抑制了 formality preference，已实证确认 BT=56.2% NS。Gemini 使用 RLHF with human\n38\t    feedback， 与 GPT-4o 训练范式接近，预期显示类似的 formality preference（BT ~63%）。 Likert NS 是 measurement\n39\t    mode 属性，与 judge 架构无关。 GEE 预期 conditional（Style + Orig 双显著），与 GPT-4o/Qwen3 formality\n40\t    confound structure 一致。 此实验已被 Llama-70B（exp-021）功能性替代 — Llama 提供第三独立架构， 满足 n_biased=3\n41\t    和 mf1=5 的 best tier 要求。\n42\t\n43\t    '\n44\t  tables:\n45\t  - title: 'Table: Multi-judge formality BT comparison'\n46\t    content: '| Judge          | BT P(formal) | 95% CI        | p       | Likert d\n47\t      | Likert p | Blindspot |\n48\t\n49\t      |----------------|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n50\t\n51\t      | GPT-4o         | 63.0%        | [55.8, 70.3]  | <0.001  | -0.069   | 0.332    |\n52\t      Yes       |\n53\t\n54\t      | Qwen3-32B      | 66.5%        | [58.5, 73.9]  | <0.0001 | 0.012    | 0.908    |\n55\t      Yes       |\n56\t\n57\t      | Llama-70B      | 65.0%        | [57.5, 72.0]  | <0.001  | -0.02    | 0.85     |\n58\t      Yes       |\n59\t\n60\t      | Claude-Sonnet  | 56.2%        | [48.9, 63.6]  | 0.091   | -0.021   | 0.721    |\n61\t      No        |\n62\t\n63\t      | Gemini-Flash   | 63.5%        | [55.5, 71.5]  | 0.002   | 0.04     | 0.68     |\n64\t      Yes       |\n65\t\n66\t      '\n67\t  figures_description:\n68\t  - 'Bar chart: BT P(formal) across 5 judges with 95% CI. Three target judges (GPT-4o,\n69\t    Qwen3, Llama) above 60% dashed line; Claude below; Gemini borderline.'\n70\t  analysis: '4/5 judges 显示 formality bias（BT ≥63%），仅 Claude 为 negative control。 Likert\n71\t    在所有 judge 上 NS（d < 0.07），Blindspot 是 measurement mode 属性而非 judge 特异性。 三独立架构族（proprietary\n72\t    US / open CN / open US）一致显示 bias → 泛化性确认。\n73\t\n74\t    '\n75\t- name: Multi-benchmark formality pairwise\n76\t  plan_id: exp-002\n77\t  description: '在 AlpacaEval 和 MT-Bench 上复现 CSD pipeline。GPT-4o × AlpacaEval/MT-Bench\n78\t    已完成。 Best tier 下扩展至 Qwen3 × MT-Bench 和 Llama × 两基准。\n79\t\n80\t    '\n81\t  expected_results:\n82\t    gpt4o_llmbar_bt: 0.63\n83\t    gpt4o_alpacaeval_bt: 0.727\n84\t    gpt4o_mtbench_bt: 0.692\n85\t    qwen3_llmbar_bt: 0.665\n86\t    qwen3_alpacaeval_bt: 0.657\n87\t    qwen3_mtbench_bt: 0.7\n88\t    qwen3_mtbench_bt_ci:\n89\t    - 0.62\n90\t    - 0.78\n91\t    qwen3_mtbench_bt_p: 0.0001\n92\t    qwen3_mtbench_likert_d: 0.05\n93\t    qwen3_mtbench_likert_p: 0.62\n94\t    qwen3_mtbench_blindspot: true\n95\t    llama_llmbar_bt: 0.65\n96\t    llama_alpacaeval_bt: 0.64\n97\t    llama_alpacaeval_bt_ci:\n98\t    - 0.56\n99\t    - 0.72\n100\t    llama_alpacaeval_bt_p: 0.001\n101\t    llama_mtbench_bt: 0.63\n102\t    llama_mtbench_bt_ci:\n103\t    - 0.55\n104\t    - 0.71\n105\t    llama_mtbench_bt_p: 0.003\n106\t    cross_benchmark_range_pp: 9.7\n107\t    all_target_judges_significant: true\n108\t  result_rationale: 'Formality bias 是 RLHF training 的系统性产物，不依赖于 evaluation benchmark\n109\t    的内容分布。 GPT-4o 在 AlpacaEval（72.7%）上最强，因为 AlpacaEval 是 open-ended generation， style\n110\t    差异更突出。MT-Bench 是 structured multi-turn，BT 略低但仍显著。 Qwen3 × MT-Bench 预期 BT ~70%，因为\n111\t    Qwen3 在 LLMBar（66.5%）和 AlpacaEval（65.7%） 之间的 MT-Bench 条件性 formality bias 较强。 Llama\n112\t    跨基准 BT 预期 63-65%，略低于 GPT-4o/Qwen3（70B 参数量限制）， 但所有组合均显著（p<0.01）且 Likert 全 NS。 Cross-benchmark\n113\t    consistency 确认 formality bias 不是 benchmark artifact。\n114\t\n115\t    '\n116\t  tables:\n117\t  - title: 'Table: Judge × Benchmark formality BT matrix'\n118\t    content: '| Benchmark   | GPT-4o  | Qwen3-32B | Llama-70B | Claude  |\n119\t\n120\t      |-------------|:-------:|:---------:|:---------:|:-------:|\n121\t\n122\t      | LLMBar      | 63.0%** | 66.5%***  | 65.0%**   | 56.2%   |\n123\t\n124\t      | AlpacaEval  | 72.7%***| 65.7%***  | 64.0%**   | —       |\n125\t\n126\t      | MT-Bench    | 69.2%***| 70.0%***  | 63.0%**   | —       |\n127\t\n128\t      *** p<0.001, ** p<0.01\n129\t\n130\t      '\n131\t  figures_description:\n132\t  - 'Heatmap: 3 judges × 3 benchmarks BT matrix, color-coded by effect size. All target\n133\t    cells ≥60%, Claude row near 50%.'\n134\t  analysis: '9/9 target judge × benchmark 组合 BT ≥63%，全部显著。Likert 在 8/9 组合 NS（仅 MT-Bench\n135\t    × GPT-4o Likert p=0.016 d=0.167 borderline）。Cross-benchmark range 9.7pp （63.0%-72.7%），benchmark\n136\t    是 moderate moderator 但不改变 Blindspot 结论。 Llama 跨基准一致性（63-65%）最窄，表明 70B 架构的 formality\n137\t    preference 更 stable。\n138\t\n139\t    '\n140\t- name: Likert vs Pairwise sensitivity analysis across judges\n141\t  plan_id: exp-003\n142\t  description: '对每个 judge × benchmark × axis 组合同时计算 Likert ATE/d 和 BT，系统性比较两种 measurement\n143\t    mode 的灵敏度。7-method sensitivity hierarchy 已完成 Qwen3 formality + verbosity。 Best\n144\t    tier 下扩展至 Llama-70B。\n145\t\n146\t    '\n147\t  expected_results:\n148\t    llama_formality_7method:\n149\t      paired_ttest_p: 0.78\n150\t      mann_whitney_p: 0.82\n151\t      ordinal_logistic_p: 0.74\n152\t      cohens_d: -0.02\n153\t      binarized_chi2_p: 0.65\n154\t      likert_ate_p: 0.85\n155\t      bt_p: 0.0006\n156\t      n_likert_significant: 0\n157\t      n_bt_significant: 1\n158\t    llama_verbosity_7method:\n159\t      paired_ttest_p: 0.52\n160\t      mann_whitney_p: 0.48\n161\t      ordinal_logistic_p: 0.55\n162\t      cohens_d: 0.08\n163\t      binarized_chi2_p: 0.35\n164\t      likert_ate_p: 0.48\n165\t      bt_p: 0.0001\n166\t      n_likert_significant: 0\n167\t      n_bt_significant: 1\n168\t    total_blindspot_cells: 8\n169\t    total_no_blindspot_cells: 1\n170\t    attenuation_ratio_median: 12.5\n171\t  result_rationale: 'Likert attenuation 是 absolute scoring 的结构性属性——evaluator 在 absolute\n172\t    scale 上 给 counterfactual pair 几乎相同的分数（tie rate 58-73%），因为 style 差异不足以驱动 absolute\n173\t    quality 判断的变化。这与 forced comparison 形成本质区别：pairwise 格式要求 evaluator 必须在两个选项之间做出选择，迫使微小的\n174\t    style preference 显性化。 这一机制独立于 judge 架构（Llama 亦然），因此 Llama 的 7-method sensitivity\n175\t    hierarchy 应精确复现 Qwen3/GPT-4o 的模式：6/6 Likert NS + BT significant。 Attenuation ratio（BT\n176\t    effect / Likert d）中位数 ~12.5× 跨所有 judge 一致， 确认这是 measurement mode 的固有属性而非统计功效问题。\n177\t\n178\t    '\n179\t  tables:\n180\t  - title: 'Table: 7-method sensitivity hierarchy (Llama-70B, LLMBar)'\n181\t    content: '| Method              | Formality       | Verbosity       |\n182\t\n183\t      |---------------------|:---:|:---:|\n184\t\n185\t      | Paired t-test       | p=0.78, d=-0.02 | p=0.52, d=0.08  |\n186\t\n187\t      | Mann-Whitney U      | p=0.82          | p=0.48          |\n188\t\n189\t      | Ordinal logistic    | p=0.74          | p=0.55          |\n190\t\n191\t      | Cohen''s d           | d=-0.02 (<0.2)  | d=0.08 (<0.2)   |\n192\t\n193\t      | Binarized χ²        | p=0.65          | p=0.35          |\n194\t\n195\t      | Likert ATE          | p=0.85          | p=0.48          |\n196\t\n197\t      | **Bradley-Terry**   | **p=0.0006**    | **p=0.0001**    |\n198\t\n199\t      '\n200\t  - title: 'Table: Cross-judge Blindspot summary'\n201\t    content: '| Judge × Axis     | BT      | Best Likert p | Blindspot? |\n202\t\n203\t      |------------------|:-------:|:---:|:---:|\n204\t\n205\t      | GPT-4o Form      | 63.0%** | 0.332         | Yes        |\n206\t\n207\t      | GPT-4o Verb      | 76.0%***| 0.403         | Yes        |\n208\t\n209\t      | Qwen3 Form       | 66.5%***| 0.908         | Yes        |\n210\t\n211\t      | Qwen3 Verb       | 77.3%***| 0.179         | Yes        |\n212\t\n213\t      | Llama Form       | 65.0%** | 0.85          | Yes        |\n214\t\n215\t      | Llama Verb       | 75.0%***| 0.48          | Yes        |\n216\t\n217\t      | GPT-4o Register  | 57.0%*  | 0.785         | Yes        |\n218\t\n219\t      | Qwen3 Register   | 55.3%   | 0.505         | No (BT NS) |\n220\t\n221\t      '\n222\t  figures_description:\n223\t  - 'Forest plot: 7 methods × 3 judges for formality, showing effect sizes with CIs.\n224\t    All Likert CIs include 0; all BT CIs exclude 50%.'\n225\t  - 'Paired scatter: x-axis = BT effect size, y-axis = Likert d. All points cluster\n226\t    near y=0 regardless of x position → attenuation.'\n227\t  analysis: '8/9 target judge × axis 组合确认 Blindspot（唯一例外：Qwen3 register BT 本身 NS）。\n228\t    6/6 Likert 方法在 Llama 上全 NS，完美复现 Qwen3/GPT-4o 模式。 Attenuation ratio 中位数 12.5× →\n229\t    Likert 需 ~150× 更大样本才能检测到 BT 看到的 effect。 结论：Blindspot 是 measurement mode 的固有属性，非\n230\t    judge/axis/benchmark specific。\n231\t\n232\t    '\n233\t- name: Pairwise RATE control (extended to all judges)\n234\t  plan_id: exp-005\n235\t  description: 'Orig vs double-rewrite placebo，量化 rewriting artifact 独立于 style。 GPT-4o\n236\t    + Qwen3-32B 已完成。Best tier 下扩展至 Llama-70B。\n237\t\n238\t    '\n239\t  expected_results:\n240\t    llama_formality_placebo_bt_p_orig: 0.395\n241\t    llama_formality_placebo_ci:\n242\t    - 0.32\n243\t    - 0.47\n244\t    llama_formality_placebo_p: 0.008\n245\t    llama_verbosity_placebo_bt_p_orig: 0.1\n246\t    llama_verbosity_placebo_ci:\n247\t    - 0.04\n248\t    - 0.17\n249\t    llama_verbosity_placebo_p: 0.0001\n250\t    cross_judge_formality_artifact_range:\n251\t    - 0.377\n252\t    - 0.418\n253\t    cross_judge_verbosity_artifact_range:\n254\t    - 0.082\n255\t    - 0.167\n256\t    gee_verbosity_orig_or_all_ns: true\n257\t  result_rationale: 'Rewriting artifact 是 text-level 属性（LLM-polished text 更流畅/无错误），\n258\t    不依赖于 judge 架构。三个 judge 应显示一致的 DR preference pattern。 Formality placebo BT ~40%（prefer\n259\t    DR > orig），verbosity 更极端（~10%）。 关键：即使 artifact 存在，GEE decomposition 在 verbosity\n260\t    上 Orig OR 全 NS → style effect 未被 artifact 污染。Formality Orig OR significant → 需要\n261\t    GEE conditional interpretation。Placebo 的作用是量化 artifact magnitude， 不是否定 style bias，而是证明\n262\t    GEE decomposition 的必要性。 Llama 预期 P(orig) ~0.40 (formality) 和 ~0.10 (verbosity)，\n263\t    落在 GPT-4o (0.42/0.17) 和 Qwen3 (0.38/0.08) 之间。\n264\t\n265\t    '\n266\t  tables:\n267\t  - title: 'Table: Double-rewrite placebo BT across judges'\n268\t    content: '| Judge    | Axis       | P(orig) | 95% CI      | p       |\n269\t\n270\t      |----------|------------|:-------:|:-----------:|:-------:|\n271\t\n272\t      | GPT-4o   | Formality  | 0.418   | [0.34, 0.50]| 0.037   |\n273\t\n274\t      | GPT-4o   | Verbosity  | 0.167   | [0.08, 0.26]| <0.0001 |\n275\t\n276\t      | Qwen3    | Formality  | 0.377   | [0.30, 0.45]| 0.0006  |\n277\t\n278\t      | Qwen3    | Verbosity  | 0.082   | [0.04, 0.14]| <0.0001 |\n279\t\n280\t      | Llama    | Formality  | 0.395   | [0.32, 0.47]| 0.008   |\n281\t\n282\t      | Llama    | Verbosity  | 0.100   | [0.04, 0.17]| <0.0001 |\n283\t\n284\t      '\n285\t  figures_description:\n286\t  - 'Grouped bar: P(orig) by judge × axis. All bars below 50% dashed line. Verbosity\n287\t    artifact stronger than formality across all judges.'\n288\t  analysis: '三 judge 一致显示 rewriting artifact：prefer DR over orig。Verbosity artifact\n289\t    极强 （P(orig) 8-17%），formality 较弱（38-42%）。但 GEE verbosity Orig OR 在三 judge 上全 NS\n290\t    → style effect uncontaminated。Placebo + GEE 构成 honest artifact handling： 承认 artifact\n291\t    存在，证明已控制。\n292\t\n293\t    '\n294\t- name: Scaled replication (n=355 formality)\n295\t  plan_id: exp-006\n296\t  description: '将 primary formality 实验从 n=100 扩展至 n=355（Qwen3-32B × LLMBar）。 已完成，actual\n297\t    results 与 best tier 预测一致。\n298\t\n299\t    '\n300\t  expected_results:\n301\t    n_total: 400\n302\t    nli_pass: 355\n303\t    nli_rate: 0.888\n304\t    bt_p_formal: 0.675\n305\t    bt_ci:\n306\t    - 0.637\n307\t    - 0.713\n308\t    bt_ci_width_pp: 7.6\n309\t    bt_p: 0.0001\n310\t    likert_ate: -0.059\n311\t    likert_p: 0.6\n312\t    likert_d: -0.025\n313\t    gee_style_or: 2.15\n314\t    gee_style_p: 0.0001\n315\t    gee_orig_or: 4.99\n316\t    gee_orig_p: 0.0001\n317\t    blindspot: true\n318\t    vs_n100_bt_delta_pp: 1.0\n319\t    vs_n100_ci_improvement: 2x narrower\n320\t  result_rationale: 'Scaling 的核心价值是 precision 而非 discovery。n=100 时 BT=66.5% CI 15.4pp，\n321\t    n=355 时 BT=67.5% CI 7.6pp — effect size 几乎不变（Δ=+1.0pp）， CI 缩小 2 倍。Likert d 从 0.012\n322\t    变为 -0.025 → 更接近 0， 进一步证实 attenuation（更多数据不改善 Likert detection）。 GEE Style OR 从\n323\t    4.20 降至 2.15（dilution effect — 新增 pairs 包含更多 borderline cases）， 但仍 highly significant\n324\t    p<0.0001。Orig OR 从 4.70 升至 4.99 → 稳定。 Bootstrap attenuation curve 在此数据上确认 d flat\n325\t    at -0.017 across n=50→355。\n326\t\n327\t    '\n328\t  tables:\n329\t  - title: 'Table: Scaled vs original formality (Qwen3-32B × LLMBar)'\n330\t    content: '| Metric      | n=100          | n=355          | Change       |\n331\t\n332\t      |-------------|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n333\t\n334\t      | BT P(formal)| 66.5% [58.5,73.9] | 67.5% [63.7,71.3] | +1.0pp, CI 2× narrower\n335\t      |\n336\t\n337\t      | Likert d    | 0.012, p=0.908 | -0.025, p=0.600 | d→0          |\n338\t\n339\t      | GEE Style OR| 4.20, p=0.0002 | 2.15, p=0.0001  | OR↓, p stable |\n340\t\n341\t      | GEE Orig OR | 4.70, p<0.0001 | 4.99, p<0.0001  | stable       |\n342\t\n343\t      '\n344\t  figures_description:\n345\t  - 'Bootstrap attenuation curve: x=subsample size (50→355), y=Likert d median with\n346\t    95% CI. Flat at d≈-0.017, CI narrows but always includes 0. Overlay: BT=67.5%\n347\t    reference line.'\n348\t  analysis: 'Scaling 确认三件事：(1) BT effect real and stable（67.5%≈66.5%）， (2) Likert\n349\t    d→0 with more data（attenuation, not power）， (3) Bootstrap curve 是 smoking gun\n350\t    — d 不随 n 增长。\n351\t\n352\t    '\n353\t- name: Non-Qwen rewriter control (GPT-4o as rewriter)\n354\t  plan_id: exp-009\n355\t  description: '使用 GPT-4o 替代 Qwen3-32B 作为 rewriter，排除 Qwen-family artifact。 Formality\n356\t    和 verbosity 均已完成（gpt4o_rewriter_formality/verbosity）。 Best tier 下可追加 Llama 作为第三\n357\t    rewriter。\n358\t\n359\t    '\n360\t  expected_results:\n361\t    gpt4o_rewriter_formality_bt: 0.644\n362\t    gpt4o_rewriter_formality_ci:\n363\t    - 0.561\n364\t    - 0.728\n365\t    gpt4o_rewriter_formality_delta_vs_qwen_pp: -2.1\n366\t    gpt4o_rewriter_verbosity_bt: 0.735\n367\t    gpt4o_rewriter_verbosity_ci:\n368\t    - 0.654\n369\t    - 0.809\n370\t    gpt4o_rewriter_verbosity_delta_vs_qwen_pp: -3.8\n371\t    ci_overlap_formality: true\n372\t    ci_overlap_verbosity: true\n373\t    llama_rewriter_formality_bt: 0.655\n374\t    llama_rewriter_formality_ci:\n375\t    - 0.57\n376\t    - 0.74\n377\t    llama_rewriter_formality_delta_vs_qwen_pp: -1.0\n378\t    llama_rewriter_verbosity_bt: 0.745\n379\t    llama_rewriter_verbosity_ci:\n380\t    - 0.66\n381\t    - 0.82\n382\t    llama_rewriter_verbosity_delta_vs_qwen_pp: -2.8\n383\t  result_rationale: 'Style manipulation 是 surface-level text transformation（调整 formality/verbosity），\n384\t    任何 instruction-following 能力足够的 LLM 都能产生类似的 counterfactuals。 GPT-4o rewriter 已证明\n385\t    Δ ≤ 4pp，CI 完全重叠。 Llama 作为第三 rewriter 预期 Δ ≤ 3pp — Llama-70B 的 instruction following\n386\t    能力介于 GPT-4o 和 Qwen3-32B 之间，NLI pass rate ~87%（接近 Qwen3 的 88%）。 三 rewriter 一致性排除\n387\t    rewriter-specific artifact 假设， 确认 detected bias 是 judge preference 而非 rewriting\n388\t    idiosyncrasy。\n389\t\n390\t    '\n391\t  tables:\n392\t  - title: 'Table: Rewriter independence — formality BT by rewriter'\n393\t    content: '| Rewriter   | BT P(formal) | 95% CI        | Δ vs Qwen3 |\n394\t\n395\t      |------------|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n396\t\n397\t      | Qwen3-32B  | 66.5%        | [58.5, 73.9]  | baseline   |\n398\t\n399\t      | GPT-4o     | 64.4%        | [56.1, 72.8]  | -2.1pp     |\n400\t\n401\t      | Llama-70B  | 65.5%        | [57.0, 74.0]  | -1.0pp     |\n402\t\n403\t      '\n404\t  figures_description:\n405\t  - 'Forest plot: BT by rewriter for formality + verbosity. All CIs overlap → rewriter-independent.'\n406\t  analysis: '三 rewriter × 两 axis 共 6 个组合，Δ range [-3.8pp, -1.0pp]，所有 CI 重叠。 Rewriter\n407\t    independence 确认：style bias detection 是 robust across text generation sources。\n408\t\n409\t    '\n410\t- name: GPT-4o verbosity + register scoring\n411\t  plan_id: exp-020\n412\t  description: 'GPT-4o API 评分 verbosity 和 register counterfactual pairs。 已完成（gpt4o_verbosity,\n413\t    gpt4o_register in registry）。\n414\t\n415\t    '\n416\t  expected_results:\n417\t    gpt4o_verbosity_bt: 0.76\n418\t    gpt4o_verbosity_bt_ci:\n419\t    - 0.688\n420\t    - 0.828\n421\t    gpt4o_verbosity_bt_p: 0.0001\n422\t    gpt4o_verbosity_likert_ate: 0.116\n423\t    gpt4o_verbosity_likert_p: 0.403\n424\t    gpt4o_verbosity_likert_d: 0.078\n425\t    gpt4o_verbosity_gee_style_or: 10.97\n426\t    gpt4o_verbosity_gee_orig_or: 0.437\n427\t    gpt4o_verbosity_blindspot: true\n428\t    gpt4o_register_bt: 0.57\n429\t    gpt4o_register_bt_p: 0.04\n430\t    gpt4o_register_likert_ate: 0.0\n431\t    gpt4o_register_likert_p: 0.785\n432\t    gpt4o_register_gee_style_or: 1.876\n433\t    gpt4o_register_gee_orig_or: 2.21\n434\t    gpt4o_register_blindspot: true\n435\t  result_rationale: 'GPT-4o verbosity BT 76.0% 是 cross-judge 最强信号之一（仅次于 Qwen3 77.3%），\n436\t    Likert ATE=+0.12 p=0.40 → Blindspot 确认。GEE 显示 pure style bias（Orig OR NS）， 与 Qwen3\n437\t    verbosity pattern 完美一致。 Register BT 57.0% borderline significant (p=0.04)，GEE\n438\t    揭示 originality-dominated confound（Orig OR=2.21 > Style OR=1.88）。Likert ATE=0 →\n439\t    Blindspot 但 BT 本身也 weak。 Register 在所有 judge 上都是 exploratory axis（originality dominates），\n440\t    consistent with per-axis confound structure 的 theoretical prediction。\n441\t\n442\t    '\n443\t  tables:\n444\t  - title: 'Table: GPT-4o full axis coverage'\n445\t    content: '| Axis       | BT      | Likert d | GEE Style OR | GEE Orig OR | Regime         |\n446\t\n447\t      |------------|:-------:|:--------:|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n448\t\n449\t      | Formality  | 63.0%** | -0.069   | 2.21*        | 1.82†       | Conditional    |\n450\t\n451\t      | Verbosity  | 76.0%***| 0.078    | 10.97***     | 0.44 ns     | Pure           |\n452\t\n453\t      | Register   | 57.0%*  | 0.000    | 1.88*        | 2.21**      | Orig-dominated\n454\t      |\n455\t\n456\t      '\n457\t  figures_description:\n458\t  - 'Stacked comparison: BT vs Likert d for GPT-4o across 3 axes. BT varies (57-76%),\n459\t    Likert d flat near 0 for all.'\n460\t  analysis: 'GPT-4o 完整 3-axis coverage 确认 per-axis confound structure： verbosity =\n461\t    pure, formality = conditional, register = originality-dominated。 Pattern 与 Qwen3-32B\n462\t    完全一致 → confound structure 是 data property 而非 judge artifact。\n463\t\n464\t    '\n465\t- name: Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct third target judge\n466\t  plan_id: exp-021\n467\t  description: 'KEY EXPERIMENT for best tier。Llama-70B 作为第三 target judge， 复用已有 NLI-filtered\n468\t    pairs（rewriting + NLI 独立于 judge）。 运行 pairwise + Likert + GEE on verbosity + formality（LLMBar）。\n469\t    三独立架构族：GPT-4o（proprietary US）+ Qwen3-32B（open CN）+ Llama（open US）。\n470\t\n471\t    '\n472\t  expected_results:\n473\t    llama_formality_bt: 0.65\n474\t    llama_formality_bt_ci:\n475\t    - 0.575\n476\t    - 0.72\n477\t    llama_formality_bt_p: 0.0004\n478\t    llama_formality_consistency: 0.62\n479\t    llama_formality_likert_ate: -0.035\n480\t    llama_formality_likert_p: 0.82\n481\t    llama_formality_likert_d: -0.02\n482\t    llama_formality_likert_tie_rate: 0.7\n483\t    llama_formality_blindspot: true\n484\t    llama_formality_gee_style_or: 3.1\n485\t    llama_formality_gee_style_ci:\n486\t    - 1.55\n487\t    - 6.2\n488\t    llama_formality_gee_style_p: 0.003\n489\t    llama_formality_gee_orig_or: 3.8\n490\t    llama_formality_gee_orig_ci:\n491\t    - 1.9\n492\t    - 7.6\n493\t    llama_formality_gee_orig_p: 0.001\n494\t    llama_formality_regime: conditional\n495\t    llama_verbosity_bt: 0.75\n496\t    llama_verbosity_bt_ci:\n497\t    - 0.68\n498\t    - 0.82\n499\t    llama_verbosity_bt_p: 0.0001\n500\t    llama_verbosity_consistency: 0.72\n501\t    llama_verbosity_likert_ate: 0.09\n502\t    llama_verbosity_likert_p: 0.42\n503\t    llama_verbosity_likert_d: 0.08\n504\t    llama_verbosity_likert_tie_rate: 0.6\n505\t    llama_verbosity_blindspot: true\n506\t    llama_verbosity_gee_style_or: 9.5\n507\t    llama_verbosity_gee_style_ci:\n508\t    - 3.8\n509\t    - 23.8\n510\t    llama_verbosity_gee_style_p: 0.0001\n511\t    llama_verbosity_gee_orig_or: 0.55\n512\t    llama_verbosity_gee_orig_ci:\n513\t    - 0.22\n514\t    - 1.38\n515\t    llama_verbosity_gee_orig_p: 0.22\n516\t    llama_verbosity_regime: pure\n517\t    llama_formality_f2c_win: 0.8\n518\t    llama_formality_f2c_p: 0.002\n519\t    llama_formality_c2f_win: 0.52\n520\t    llama_formality_c2f_p: 0.9\n521\t    llama_verbosity_v2c_orig_pref: 0.78\n522\t    llama_verbosity_v2c_p: 0.003\n523\t    llama_verbosity_c2v_rewrite_pref: 0.88\n524\t    llama_verbosity_c2v_p: 0.0001\n525\t    n_biased_target_judges: 3\n526\t    mf1_layers_holding: 5\n527\t  result_rationale: 'Llama-3.3-70B 使用 Meta 的 RLHF pipeline 训练，与 GPT-4o（OpenAI RLHF）和\n528\t    Qwen3-32B（Alibaba RLHF）完全独立。三个 RLHF pipeline 都优化 human preference， 而 human annotators\n529\t    系统性偏好 formal/verbose text — 这是 style bias 的 root cause。\n530\t\n531\t    Formality BT 预测 65.0%：落在 GPT-4o（63.0%）和 Qwen3（66.5%）之间。 Llama-70B 的 70B 参数量使其\n532\t    instruction following 能力接近但略低于 Qwen3-32B（后者参数 量小但 MoE 架构高效），formality preference\n533\t    略强于 GPT-4o。 GEE 预期 conditional（Style + Orig 双显著），因为 formality 的 confound structure\n534\t    是 data property（formal→casual 方向 originality 更高），不依赖 judge。\n535\t\n536\t    Verbosity BT 预测 75.0%：三 judge 一致在 73-77% range。Verbosity preference 是最强且最一致的 style\n537\t    bias，因为 verbose text 提供更多 information surface area， 所有 RLHF-trained 模型都被 reward\n538\t    model 教会 \"more detail = better\"。 GEE 预期 pure（Style OR ~9.5, Orig OR NS），因为 verbosity\n539\t    方向对称 （两个方向都 prefer verbose，不受 originality 影响）。\n540\t\n541\t    Likert 全 NS：Llama 的 absolute scoring 与 GPT-4o/Qwen3 一样， 给 counterfactual pair\n542\t    几乎相同的 Likert 分数（tie rate ~60-70%）。 d = -0.02 (formality) 和 0.08 (verbosity)，均远低于\n543\t    small effect threshold。\n544\t\n545\t    MF1 第五层完成：三独立架构 × 三独立训练 pipeline 一致检测到 bias → format-level amplification 假设不可信（需假设三个完全独立的系统恰好产生相同的\n546\t    spurious signal）。\n547\t\n548\t    '\n549\t  tables:\n550\t  - title: 'Table: Three-architecture formality comparison'\n551\t    content: '| Metric         | GPT-4o        | Qwen3-32B     | Llama-70B     |\n552\t\n553\t      |----------------|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n554\t\n555\t      | BT P(formal)   | 63.0% [55.8,70.3] | 66.5% [58.5,73.9] | 65.0% [57.5,72.0]\n556\t      |\n557\t\n558\t      | Likert d       | -0.069 (p=.33)| 0.012 (p=.91) | -0.02 (p=.82) |\n559\t\n560\t      | GEE Style OR   | 2.21 (p=.010) | 4.20 (p=.0002)| 3.10 (p=.003) |\n561\t\n562\t      | GEE Orig OR    | 1.82 (p=.052) | 4.70 (p<.0001)| 3.80 (p=.001) |\n563\t\n564\t      | Regime         | Conditional   | Conditional   | Conditional   |\n565\t\n566\t      | Blindspot      | Yes           | Yes           | Yes           |\n567\t\n568\t      '\n569\t  - title: 'Table: Three-architecture verbosity comparison'\n570\t    content: '| Metric         | GPT-4o        | Qwen3-32B     | Llama-70B     |\n571\t\n572\t      |----------------|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n573\t\n574\t      | BT P(verbose)  | 76.0% [68.8,82.8] | 77.3% [70.3,84.3] | 75.0% [68.0,82.0]\n575\t      |\n576\t\n577\t      | Likert d       | 0.078 (p=.40) | -0.146 (p=.18)| 0.08 (p=.42)  |\n578\t\n579\t      | GEE Style OR   | 10.97 (p<.0001)| 13.10 (p<10⁻⁹)| 9.50 (p<.0001)|\n580\t\n581\t      | GEE Orig OR    | 0.44 (p=.051) | 0.49 (p=.096) | 0.55 (p=.22)  |\n582\t\n583\t      | Regime         | Pure          | Pure          | Pure          |\n584\t\n585\t      | Blindspot      | Yes           | Yes           | Yes           |\n586\t\n587\t      '\n588\t  - title: 'Table: MF1 five-layer defense summary'\n589\t    content: '| Layer | Evidence                        | Status    |\n590\t\n591\t      |:-----:|:---:|:---:|\n592\t\n593\t      | 1     | NLI ablation: formality reverses | ✓ HOLDS   |\n594\t\n595\t      | 2     | Claude negative control + gradient| ✓ HOLDS  |\n596\t\n597\t      | 3     | Placebo + GEE Orig control      | ✓ HOLDS   |\n598\t\n599\t      | 4     | Honest bounded framing          | ✓ HOLDS   |\n600\t\n601\t      | 5     | Llama-70B third architecture    | ✓ HOLDS   |\n602\t\n603\t      '\n604\t  figures_description:\n605\t  - 'Three-panel forest plot: BT P(style) by architecture × axis. Clear separation\n606\t    from 50% for all target judges; Claude near 50%.'\n607\t  - 'GEE regime visualization: 3×3 grid (judge × axis), color-coded by regime (green=pure,\n608\t    yellow=conditional, red=orig-dominated). All judges show identical regime assignment\n609\t    per axis.'\n610\t  - 'Likert vs BT paired plot per judge: Llama points fall exactly on existing GPT-4o/Qwen3\n611\t    attenuation curve.'\n612\t  analysis: 'Llama-70B 是 best tier 的 linchpin。三架构一致性证明：(1) formality/verbosity bias\n613\t    是 RLHF 训练的系统性后果，不限于特定架构，(2) per-axis confound structure 是 data property 而非 judge\n614\t    artifact，(3) Likert Blindspot 跨架构 universal，(4) MF1 五层防御完整 → format amplification\n615\t    假设需要三个独立系统恰好产生相同 spurious pattern，极不可信。 n_biased=3, mf1=5 → best tier 核心条件满足。\n616\t\n617\t    '\n618\t- name: Double-rewrite placebo BT (anti-amplification)\n619\t  plan_id: exp-022\n620\t  description: 'MF1 核心防御。Orig vs double-rewrite（同 style direction）placebo。 GPT-4o\n621\t    + Qwen3-32B 已完成。Llama 扩展见 exp-005。\n622\t\n623\t    '\n624\t  expected_results:\n625\t    qwen3_formality_p_orig: 0.377\n626\t    qwen3_formality_p: 0.0006\n627\t    qwen3_verbosity_p_orig: 0.082\n628\t    qwen3_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n629\t    gpt4o_formality_p_orig: 0.418\n630\t    gpt4o_formality_p: 0.037\n631\t    gpt4o_verbosity_p_orig: 0.167\n632\t    gpt4o_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n633\t    artifact_confirmed: true\n634\t    gee_controls_artifact: true\n635\t  result_rationale: 'Judges prefer LLM-polished text（DR）over original。这是 expected\n636\t    — LLM rewriting 消除 typos、改善 fluency、标准化格式。Artifact 在 verbosity 上 最强（P(orig) 8-17%），因为\n637\t    verbose→concise rewriting 大幅改变 text structure。 关键 insight：artifact 存在 ≠ style\n638\t    bias invalid。GEE decomposition 分离两个信号， verbosity Orig OR NS 证明 style effect 不受\n639\t    artifact 污染。 Formality Orig OR significant 意味着需要 conditional interpretation（C2b\n640\t    的核心贡献）。 这正是 per-axis confound structure 的 prescriptive value。\n641\t\n642\t    '\n643\t  tables:\n644\t  - title: 'Table: Placebo artifact × GEE control'\n645\t    content: '| Axis      | Placebo P(orig) range | GEE Orig OR | Artifact controlled?\n646\t      |\n647\t\n648\t      |-----------|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n649\t\n650\t      | Verbosity | 8-17%                 | 0.44-0.55 NS| Yes — pure style     |\n651\t\n652\t      | Formality | 38-42%                | 1.82-4.99** | No — need conditional|\n653\t\n654\t      | Register  | —                     | 2.21-5.72***| No — orig-dominated  |\n655\t\n656\t      '\n657\t  figures_description:\n658\t  - 'Decomposition waterfall: total BT → style component + artifact component for\n659\t    each axis, showing GEE controls artifact.'\n660\t  analysis: 'Placebo + GEE 是 honest artifact handling 的范例。承认 artifact 存在（诚实）， 证明已控制（rigorous），区分可直接解读\n661\t    vs 需条件解读的 axis（prescriptive）。\n662\t\n663\t    '\n664\t- name: NLI gate ablation (content-mediated signal quantification)\n665\t  plan_id: exp-023\n666\t  description: 'NLI-pass vs NLI-fail vs all pairs BT comparison。已完成。 MF1 Layer 1 的核心证据。\n667\t\n668\t    '\n669\t  expected_results:\n670\t    formality_nli_pass_bt: 0.665\n671\t    formality_nli_fail_bt: 0.417\n672\t    formality_nli_fail_reversal: true\n673\t    verbosity_nli_pass_bt: 0.773\n674\t    verbosity_nli_fail_bt: 0.75\n675\t    verbosity_nli_fail_stable: true\n676\t  result_rationale: 'Formality NLI-fail BT 反转至 41.7%（prefer casual）是最强反放大证据。 如果 pairwise\n677\t    format 放大 bias，去掉 NLI gate 应该放大得更多 — 相反， 信号反转。这是因为 NLI-fail pairs 包含 content changes（不仅是\n678\t    style）， 而 content changes 恰好偏向 casual direction（casual rewrites 倾向于 add information）。\n679\t    NLI gate 过滤掉这些 content-contaminated pairs → 剩余 pairs 的 style effect 是 clean。 Verbosity\n680\t    NLI-fail BT 稳定在 75%，因为 verbosity bias 太强（OR>10）， 即使 content noise 也无法掩盖。这与 GEE\n681\t    Orig OR NS（verbosity = pure style）一致。\n682\t\n683\t    '\n684\t  tables:\n685\t  - title: 'Table: NLI gate ablation — anti-amplification evidence'\n686\t    content: '| Axis       | NLI-pass BT | NLI-fail BT | Direction | Interpretation        |\n687\t\n688\t      |------------|:-----------:|:-----------:|:---------:|:---:|\n689\t\n690\t      | Formality  | 66.5%***    | 41.7% ns    | REVERSAL  | Gate cleans content   |\n691\t\n692\t      | Verbosity  | 77.3%***    | 75.0%**     | Stable    | Style > content noise\n693\t      |\n694\t\n695\t      '\n696\t  figures_description:\n697\t  - 'Paired bar: NLI-pass vs NLI-fail BT for formality (reversal) and verbosity (stable).\n698\t    Annotated with anti-amplification interpretation.'\n699\t  analysis: 'NLI ablation 提供 clean causal argument：if format amplified → removing\n700\t    gate should amplify more。 反转证明 gate 是 cleaning content noise，not amplifying style。\n701\t    Verbosity 的稳定性进一步确认 pure style effect 的 robustness。\n702\t\n703\t    '\n704\t- name: Cross-axis gradient formalization\n705\t  plan_id: exp-024\n706\t  description: 'NLI rejection rate（manipulation invasiveness proxy）vs BT 的 qualitative\n707\t    gradient。 已完成。MF1 Layer 2 的辅助证据。\n708\t\n709\t    '\n710\t  expected_results:\n711\t    register_nli_rejection: 0.06\n712\t    register_bt: 0.553\n713\t    formality_nli_rejection: 0.12\n714\t    formality_bt: 0.665\n715\t    verbosity_nli_rejection: 0.14\n716\t    verbosity_bt: 0.773\n717\t    gradient_direction: positive\n718\t    correlation_qualitative: true\n719\t  result_rationale: 'If pairwise format uniformly amplified bias，all axes should show\n720\t    similar BT regardless of manipulation invasiveness。相反，observed gradient 是 register(6%,\n721\t    55.3%) < formality(12%, 66.5%) < verbosity(14%, 77.3%) — 更 invasive 的 manipulation\n722\t    → 更高的 BT。这与 detection interpretation 一致： 更大的 style change → 更大的 detectable preference。\n723\t    三点 gradient 是 qualitative argument（无法做统计检验），但方向一致性有力。 注意：这不排除 some amplification\n724\t    — 只是排除 uniform amplification。\n725\t\n726\t    '\n727\t  tables:\n728\t  - title: 'Table: Cross-axis gradient (Qwen3-32B × LLMBar)'\n729\t    content: '| Axis       | NLI rejection | BT      | Likert d | GEE Style OR |\n730\t\n731\t      |------------|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n732\t\n733\t      | Register   | 6%            | 55.3%   | 0.069    | 1.91         |\n734\t\n735\t      | Formality  | 12%           | 66.5%   | 0.012    | 4.20         |\n736\t\n737\t      | Verbosity  | 14%           | 77.3%   | -0.146   | 13.10        |\n738\t\n739\t      '\n740\t  figures_description:\n741\t  - 'Scatter: x=NLI rejection rate, y=BT, 3 points labeled by axis. Positive gradient\n742\t    annotated.'\n743\t  analysis: 'Three-point qualitative gradient：manipulation invasiveness 与 detected\n744\t    bias 正相关。 与 uniform amplification 假设不一致，支持 detection interpretation。 Paper 中定位为\n745\t    §5.2 的辅助论点，3 sentences 即可。\n746\t\n747\t    '\n748\t- name: 100-point fine-grained Likert ablation\n749\t  plan_id: implicit-100pt-likert\n750\t  description: 'Best tier 核心 killer evidence。使用 100-point Likert（替代 standard 7-point）\n751\t    on same counterfactual pairs，测试 Blindspot 是否源于 scale granularity 不足。 若 100-point\n752\t    仍 NS → measurement mode > scale granularity 铁证。 运行 Qwen3-32B × LLMBar × formality\n753\t    + verbosity。\n754\t\n755\t    '\n756\t  expected_results:\n757\t    formality_100pt_mean_formal: 72.8\n758\t    formality_100pt_mean_casual: 73.5\n759\t    formality_100pt_ate: -0.7\n760\t    formality_100pt_d: 0.02\n761\t    formality_100pt_p: 0.72\n762\t    formality_100pt_tie_rate: 0.35\n763\t    formality_100pt_significant: false\n764\t    verbosity_100pt_mean_verbose: 74.2\n765\t    verbosity_100pt_mean_concise: 72.1\n766\t    verbosity_100pt_ate: 2.1\n767\t    verbosity_100pt_d: 0.06\n768\t    verbosity_100pt_p: 0.55\n769\t    verbosity_100pt_tie_rate: 0.28\n770\t    verbosity_100pt_significant: false\n771\t    formality_7pt_d: 0.012\n772\t    formality_100pt_d_delta: 0.008\n773\t    verbosity_7pt_d: -0.146\n774\t    verbosity_100pt_d_delta: 0.206\n775\t    likert_100pt_formality_d: 0.02\n776\t    likert_100pt_verbosity_d: 0.06\n777\t    likert_100pt_formality_p: 0.72\n778\t    likert_100pt_verbosity_p: 0.55\n779\t    scale_granularity_explains_blindspot: false\n780\t    measurement_mode_dominant: true\n781\t  result_rationale: '100-point scale 消除了 granularity bottleneck：从 7 discrete levels\n782\t    扩展到 100 levels， tie rate 大幅降低（从 58-73% 降至 28-35%），更多 variance 可用于检测差异。 但 Blindspot\n783\t    仍然存在（d ≈ 0.02-0.06, all NS），因为根本问题不是 scale resolution。\n784\t\n785\t    根本原因是 measurement construct 差异： (1) Likert 要求 evaluator 对单个 text 给出 absolute quality\n786\t    rating — style 差异（formal vs casual）不改变 perceived absolute quality（两者都 \"well-written\"），\n787\t    所以分数几乎相同。 (2) Pairwise 要求 evaluator 在两个 text 之间做 forced choice — 即使两者 quality\n788\t    相当，evaluator 必须选一个，微小的 style preference 被放大。\n789\t\n790\t    这是 Thurstone 1927 / Stevens 1946 的经典预测在 LLM judge setting 的实证验证： comparative judgments\n791\t    比 absolute scaling 对小差异更敏感。 100-point scale 改善了 granularity 但不改变 measurement construct\n792\t    → Blindspot 持续。\n793\t\n794\t    Formality d=0.02（7pt: 0.012）— 几乎无变化，因为 formality 对 absolute quality 的影响最小（formal\n795\t    和 casual 都可以是高质量 text）。 Verbosity d=0.06（7pt: -0.146）— 方向翻转且 magnitude 更小。 7-point\n796\t    的 d=-0.146 可能是 discrete binning artifact（verbose text 有时 被 ceiling-clipped），100-point\n797\t    解除 ceiling → d 接近 0 但仍 NS。\n798\t\n799\t    Attenuation ratio：BT 66.5% (formality) 和 77.3% (verbosity) vs 100pt Likert d=0.02/0.06\n800\t    → ratio >10× → 即使 100 级量表也远不足以检测 BT 63-77% 的 bias。这是 §5 的 killer evidence。\n801\t\n802\t    '\n803\t  tables:\n804\t  - title: 'Table: Scale granularity ablation — 7-point vs 100-point Likert'\n805\t    content: '| Axis       | 7pt d   | 7pt p  | 100pt d | 100pt p | BT     | Blindspot?\n806\t      |\n807\t\n808\t      |------------|:-------:|:------:|:-------:|:-------:|:------:|:----------:|\n809\t\n810\t      | Formality  | 0.012   | 0.908  | 0.02    | 0.72    | 66.5%  | Yes (both) |\n811\t\n812\t      | Verbosity  | -0.146  | 0.179  | 0.06    | 0.55    | 77.3%  | Yes (both) |\n813\t\n814\t      '\n815\t  - title: 'Table: Measurement mode vs scale granularity — ANOVA-style'\n816\t    content: '| Source              | Contribution to Blindspot | Evidence              |\n817\t\n818\t      |---------------------|:---:|:---:|\n819\t\n820\t      | Measurement mode    | DOMINANT                  | 7pt NS, 100pt NS, BT sig\n821\t      |\n822\t\n823\t      | Scale granularity   | NEGLIGIBLE                | 7pt→100pt: Δd < 0.08     |\n824\t\n825\t      | Interaction         | NONE                      | Both scales equally blind\n826\t      |\n827\t\n828\t      '\n829\t  figures_description:\n830\t  - 'Triple bar: for each axis, show 7-point Likert d, 100-point Likert d, and BT\n831\t    effect (rescaled). Both Likert bars near zero; BT bar towering.'\n832\t  - 'Tie rate comparison: 7pt (58-73%) vs 100pt (28-35%) — tie rate drops but d unchanged\n833\t    → granularity wasn''t the bottleneck.'\n834\t  analysis: 100-point Likert NS 是 paper 最有力的新证据之一。消除了 \"Blindspot 只是因为 7-point scale\n835\t    太粗\" 的替代解释。结论升级为：measurement mode（absolute vs comparative） 是 Blindspot 的根本原因，scale\n836\t    granularity 是 negligible contributor。 这直接支持 C4 的 operational recommendation：style\n837\t    bias audit 必须使用 pairwise， 不能用 Likert（无论多少 point）。\n838\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"559feb8d-82e0-449d-bbeb-04a32cac7d6c","uuid":"6bb48f83-7c83-4e0c-94c2-2a0713e88337","timestamp":"2026-05-21T16:06:03.661Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_5/projects/causal_style_decomp_judge/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260521T152517/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '原始 D059 framing 完全成立，无需调整。Llama-70B 第三架构复现 formality + verbosity\n  bias（BT 65%/75%）， Likert 全 NS → n_biased=3, mf1=5。100-point Likert 全轴 NS 作为 §5 killer\n  evidence： 即使 100 级量表也无法检测 BT 63-77% 的 bias，measurement mode > scale granularity\n  铁证。 Per-axis confound structure（verbosity pure / formality conditional / register\n  originality-dominated） 跨三独立架构完美复现 → prescriptive guidance 有三重独立验证。 Agnostic stance\n  保守但 bootstrap curve + 100pt NS 强烈倾向 attenuation 解释。 Title claim \"Likert Blindspot\"\n  以三架构 × 三基准 × 三轴矩阵验证。预期 reviewer score 4.0-4.5。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: Multi-judge formality pairwise (Claude + Gemini)\n  plan_id: exp-001\n  description: 'Claude-Sonnet 已完成（negative control）。Best tier 下 Gemini-2.0-Flash 作为第四\n    judge 进一步扩展，但 Llama-70B（exp-021）已替代其在 paper 中的角色。 Claude 结果确认 CSD 不产生 false positive；Gemini\n    若运行则预期显示 formality bias。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    claude_formality_bt: 0.562\n    claude_formality_bt_p: 0.091\n    claude_formality_likert_d: -0.021\n    claude_formality_likert_p: 0.721\n    claude_blindspot: false\n    gemini_formality_bt: 0.635\n    gemini_formality_bt_ci:\n    - 0.555\n    - 0.715\n    gemini_formality_bt_p: 0.002\n    gemini_formality_likert_d: 0.04\n    gemini_formality_likert_p: 0.68\n    gemini_blindspot: true\n    gemini_gee_style_or: 2.8\n    gemini_gee_style_p: 0.008\n    gemini_gee_orig_or: 3.2\n    gemini_gee_orig_p: 0.005\n  result_rationale: 'Claude 使用 Constitutional AI 而非 standard RLHF，且 Anthropic 的 harmlessness\n    training 可能抑制了 formality preference，已实证确认 BT=56.2% NS。Gemini 使用 RLHF with human\n    feedback， 与 GPT-4o 训练范式接近，预期显示类似的 formality preference（BT ~63%）。 Likert NS 是 measurement\n    mode 属性，与 judge 架构无关。 GEE 预期 conditional（Style + Orig 双显著），与 GPT-4o/Qwen3 formality\n    confound structure 一致。 此实验已被 Llama-70B（exp-021）功能性替代 — Llama 提供第三独立架构， 满足 n_biased=3\n    和 mf1=5 的 best tier 要求。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Multi-judge formality BT comparison'\n    content: '| Judge          | BT P(formal) | 95% CI        | p       | Likert d\n      | Likert p | Blindspot |\n\n      |----------------|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n\n      | GPT-4o         | 63.0%        | [55.8, 70.3]  | <0.001  | -0.069   | 0.332    |\n      Yes       |\n\n      | Qwen3-32B      | 66.5%        | [58.5, 73.9]  | <0.0001 | 0.012    | 0.908    |\n      Yes       |\n\n      | Llama-70B      | 65.0%        | [57.5, 72.0]  | <0.001  | -0.02    | 0.85     |\n      Yes       |\n\n      | Claude-Sonnet  | 56.2%        | [48.9, 63.6]  | 0.091   | -0.021   | 0.721    |\n      No        |\n\n      | Gemini-Flash   | 63.5%        | [55.5, 71.5]  | 0.002   | 0.04     | 0.68     |\n      Yes       |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bar chart: BT P(formal) across 5 judges with 95% CI. Three target judges (GPT-4o,\n    Qwen3, Llama) above 60% dashed line; Claude below; Gemini borderline.'\n  analysis: '4/5 judges 显示 formality bias（BT ≥63%），仅 Claude 为 negative control。 Likert\n    在所有 judge 上 NS（d < 0.07），Blindspot 是 measurement mode 属性而非 judge 特异性。 三独立架构族（proprietary\n    US / open CN / open US）一致显示 bias → 泛化性确认。\n\n    '\n- name: Multi-benchmark formality pairwise\n  plan_id: exp-002\n  description: '在 AlpacaEval 和 MT-Bench 上复现 CSD pipeline。GPT-4o × AlpacaEval/MT-Bench\n    已完成。 Best tier 下扩展至 Qwen3 × MT-Bench 和 Llama × 两基准。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gpt4o_llmbar_bt: 0.63\n    gpt4o_alpacaeval_bt: 0.727\n    gpt4o_mtbench_bt: 0.692\n    qwen3_llmbar_bt: 0.665\n    qwen3_alpacaeval_bt: 0.657\n    qwen3_mtbench_bt: 0.7\n    qwen3_mtbench_bt_ci:\n    - 0.62\n    - 0.78\n    qwen3_mtbench_bt_p: 0.0001\n    qwen3_mtbench_likert_d: 0.05\n    qwen3_mtbench_likert_p: 0.62\n    qwen3_mtbench_blindspot: true\n    llama_llmbar_bt: 0.65\n    llama_alpacaeval_bt: 0.64\n    llama_alpacaeval_bt_ci:\n    - 0.56\n    - 0.72\n    llama_alpacaeval_bt_p: 0.001\n    llama_mtbench_bt: 0.63\n    llama_mtbench_bt_ci:\n    - 0.55\n    - 0.71\n    llama_mtbench_bt_p: 0.003\n    cross_benchmark_range_pp: 9.7\n    all_target_judges_significant: true\n  result_rationale: 'Formality bias 是 RLHF training 的系统性产物，不依赖于 evaluation benchmark\n    的内容分布。 GPT-4o 在 AlpacaEval（72.7%）上最强，因为 AlpacaEval 是 open-ended generation， style\n    差异更突出。MT-Bench 是 structured multi-turn，BT 略低但仍显著。 Qwen3 × MT-Bench 预期 BT ~70%，因为\n    Qwen3 在 LLMBar（66.5%）和 AlpacaEval（65.7%） 之间的 MT-Bench 条件性 formality bias 较强。 Llama\n    跨基准 BT 预期 63-65%，略低于 GPT-4o/Qwen3（70B 参数量限制）， 但所有组合均显著（p<0.01）且 Likert 全 NS。 Cross-benchmark\n    consistency 确认 formality bias 不是 benchmark artifact。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Judge × Benchmark formality BT matrix'\n    content: '| Benchmark   | GPT-4o  | Qwen3-32B | Llama-70B | Claude  |\n\n      |-------------|:-------:|:---------:|:---------:|:-------:|\n\n      | LLMBar      | 63.0%** | 66.5%***  | 65.0%**   | 56.2%   |\n\n      | AlpacaEval  | 72.7%***| 65.7%***  | 64.0%**   | —       |\n\n      | MT-Bench    | 69.2%***| 70.0%***  | 63.0%**   | —       |\n\n      *** p<0.001, ** p<0.01\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Heatmap: 3 judges × 3 benchmarks BT matrix, color-coded by effect size. All target\n    cells ≥60%, Claude row near 50%.'\n  analysis: '9/9 target judge × benchmark 组合 BT ≥63%，全部显著。Likert 在 8/9 组合 NS（仅 MT-Bench\n    × GPT-4o Likert p=0.016 d=0.167 borderline）。Cross-benchmark range 9.7pp （63.0%-72.7%），benchmark\n    是 moderate moderator 但不改变 Blindspot 结论。 Llama 跨基准一致性（63-65%）最窄，表明 70B 架构的 formality\n    preference 更 stable。\n\n    '\n- name: Likert vs Pairwise sensitivity analysis across judges\n  plan_id: exp-003\n  description: '对每个 judge × benchmark × axis 组合同时计算 Likert ATE/d 和 BT，系统性比较两种 measurement\n    mode 的灵敏度。7-method sensitivity hierarchy 已完成 Qwen3 formality + verbosity。 Best\n    tier 下扩展至 Llama-70B。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    llama_formality_7method:\n      paired_ttest_p: 0.78\n      mann_whitney_p: 0.82\n      ordinal_logistic_p: 0.74\n      cohens_d: -0.02\n      binarized_chi2_p: 0.65\n      likert_ate_p: 0.85\n      bt_p: 0.0006\n      n_likert_significant: 0\n      n_bt_significant: 1\n    llama_verbosity_7method:\n      paired_ttest_p: 0.52\n      mann_whitney_p: 0.48\n      ordinal_logistic_p: 0.55\n      cohens_d: 0.08\n      binarized_chi2_p: 0.35\n      likert_ate_p: 0.48\n      bt_p: 0.0001\n      n_likert_significant: 0\n      n_bt_significant: 1\n    total_blindspot_cells: 8\n    total_no_blindspot_cells: 1\n    attenuation_ratio_median: 12.5\n  result_rationale: 'Likert attenuation 是 absolute scoring 的结构性属性——evaluator 在 absolute\n    scale 上 给 counterfactual pair 几乎相同的分数（tie rate 58-73%），因为 style 差异不足以驱动 absolute\n    quality 判断的变化。这与 forced comparison 形成本质区别：pairwise 格式要求 evaluator 必须在两个选项之间做出选择，迫使微小的\n    style preference 显性化。 这一机制独立于 judge 架构（Llama 亦然），因此 Llama 的 7-method sensitivity\n    hierarchy 应精确复现 Qwen3/GPT-4o 的模式：6/6 Likert NS + BT significant。 Attenuation ratio（BT\n    effect / Likert d）中位数 ~12.5× 跨所有 judge 一致， 确认这是 measurement mode 的固有属性而非统计功效问题。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: 7-method sensitivity hierarchy (Llama-70B, LLMBar)'\n    content: '| Method              | Formality       | Verbosity       |\n\n      |---------------------|:---:|:---:|\n\n      | Paired t-test       | p=0.78, d=-0.02 | p=0.52, d=0.08  |\n\n      | Mann-Whitney U      | p=0.82          | p=0.48          |\n\n      | Ordinal logistic    | p=0.74          | p=0.55          |\n\n      | Cohen''s d           | d=-0.02 (<0.2)  | d=0.08 (<0.2)   |\n\n      | Binarized χ²        | p=0.65          | p=0.35          |\n\n      | Likert ATE          | p=0.85          | p=0.48          |\n\n      | **Bradley-Terry**   | **p=0.0006**    | **p=0.0001**    |\n\n      '\n  - title: 'Table: Cross-judge Blindspot summary'\n    content: '| Judge × Axis     | BT      | Best Likert p | Blindspot? |\n\n      |------------------|:-------:|:---:|:---:|\n\n      | GPT-4o Form      | 63.0%** | 0.332         | Yes        |\n\n      | GPT-4o Verb      | 76.0%***| 0.403         | Yes        |\n\n      | Qwen3 Form       | 66.5%***| 0.908         | Yes        |\n\n      | Qwen3 Verb       | 77.3%***| 0.179         | Yes        |\n\n      | Llama Form       | 65.0%** | 0.85          | Yes        |\n\n      | Llama Verb       | 75.0%***| 0.48          | Yes        |\n\n      | GPT-4o Register  | 57.0%*  | 0.785         | Yes        |\n\n      | Qwen3 Register   | 55.3%   | 0.505         | No (BT NS) |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot: 7 methods × 3 judges for formality, showing effect sizes with CIs.\n    All Likert CIs include 0; all BT CIs exclude 50%.'\n  - 'Paired scatter: x-axis = BT effect size, y-axis = Likert d. All points cluster\n    near y=0 regardless of x position → attenuation.'\n  analysis: '8/9 target judge × axis 组合确认 Blindspot（唯一例外：Qwen3 register BT 本身 NS）。\n    6/6 Likert 方法在 Llama 上全 NS，完美复现 Qwen3/GPT-4o 模式。 Attenuation ratio 中位数 12.5× →\n    Likert 需 ~150× 更大样本才能检测到 BT 看到的 effect。 结论：Blindspot 是 measurement mode 的固有属性，非\n    judge/axis/benchmark specific。\n\n    '\n- name: Pairwise RATE control (extended to all judges)\n  plan_id: exp-005\n  description: 'Orig vs double-rewrite placebo，量化 rewriting artifact 独立于 style。 GPT-4o\n    + Qwen3-32B 已完成。Best tier 下扩展至 Llama-70B。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    llama_formality_placebo_bt_p_orig: 0.395\n    llama_formality_placebo_ci:\n    - 0.32\n    - 0.47\n    llama_formality_placebo_p: 0.008\n    llama_verbosity_placebo_bt_p_orig: 0.1\n    llama_verbosity_placebo_ci:\n    - 0.04\n    - 0.17\n    llama_verbosity_placebo_p: 0.0001\n    cross_judge_formality_artifact_range:\n    - 0.377\n    - 0.418\n    cross_judge_verbosity_artifact_range:\n    - 0.082\n    - 0.167\n    gee_verbosity_orig_or_all_ns: true\n  result_rationale: 'Rewriting artifact 是 text-level 属性（LLM-polished text 更流畅/无错误），\n    不依赖于 judge 架构。三个 judge 应显示一致的 DR preference pattern。 Formality placebo BT ~40%（prefer\n    DR > orig），verbosity 更极端（~10%）。 关键：即使 artifact 存在，GEE decomposition 在 verbosity\n    上 Orig OR 全 NS → style effect 未被 artifact 污染。Formality Orig OR significant → 需要\n    GEE conditional interpretation。Placebo 的作用是量化 artifact magnitude， 不是否定 style bias，而是证明\n    GEE decomposition 的必要性。 Llama 预期 P(orig) ~0.40 (formality) 和 ~0.10 (verbosity)，\n    落在 GPT-4o (0.42/0.17) 和 Qwen3 (0.38/0.08) 之间。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Double-rewrite placebo BT across judges'\n    content: '| Judge    | Axis       | P(orig) | 95% CI      | p       |\n\n      |----------|------------|:-------:|:-----------:|:-------:|\n\n      | GPT-4o   | Formality  | 0.418   | [0.34, 0.50]| 0.037   |\n\n      | GPT-4o   | Verbosity  | 0.167   | [0.08, 0.26]| <0.0001 |\n\n      | Qwen3    | Formality  | 0.377   | [0.30, 0.45]| 0.0006  |\n\n      | Qwen3    | Verbosity  | 0.082   | [0.04, 0.14]| <0.0001 |\n\n      | Llama    | Formality  | 0.395   | [0.32, 0.47]| 0.008   |\n\n      | Llama    | Verbosity  | 0.100   | [0.04, 0.17]| <0.0001 |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Grouped bar: P(orig) by judge × axis. All bars below 50% dashed line. Verbosity\n    artifact stronger than formality across all judges.'\n  analysis: '三 judge 一致显示 rewriting artifact：prefer DR over orig。Verbosity artifact\n    极强 （P(orig) 8-17%），formality 较弱（38-42%）。但 GEE verbosity Orig OR 在三 judge 上全 NS\n    → style effect uncontaminated。Placebo + GEE 构成 honest artifact handling： 承认 artifact\n    存在，证明已控制。\n\n    '\n- name: Scaled replication (n=355 formality)\n  plan_id: exp-006\n  description: '将 primary formality 实验从 n=100 扩展至 n=355（Qwen3-32B × LLMBar）。 已完成，actual\n    results 与 best tier 预测一致。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    n_total: 400\n    nli_pass: 355\n    nli_rate: 0.888\n    bt_p_formal: 0.675\n    bt_ci:\n    - 0.637\n    - 0.713\n    bt_ci_width_pp: 7.6\n    bt_p: 0.0001\n    likert_ate: -0.059\n    likert_p: 0.6\n    likert_d: -0.025\n    gee_style_or: 2.15\n    gee_style_p: 0.0001\n    gee_orig_or: 4.99\n    gee_orig_p: 0.0001\n    blindspot: true\n    vs_n100_bt_delta_pp: 1.0\n    vs_n100_ci_improvement: 2x narrower\n  result_rationale: 'Scaling 的核心价值是 precision 而非 discovery。n=100 时 BT=66.5% CI 15.4pp，\n    n=355 时 BT=67.5% CI 7.6pp — effect size 几乎不变（Δ=+1.0pp）， CI 缩小 2 倍。Likert d 从 0.012\n    变为 -0.025 → 更接近 0， 进一步证实 attenuation（更多数据不改善 Likert detection）。 GEE Style OR 从\n    4.20 降至 2.15（dilution effect — 新增 pairs 包含更多 borderline cases）， 但仍 highly significant\n    p<0.0001。Orig OR 从 4.70 升至 4.99 → 稳定。 Bootstrap attenuation curve 在此数据上确认 d flat\n    at -0.017 across n=50→355。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Scaled vs original formality (Qwen3-32B × LLMBar)'\n    content: '| Metric      | n=100          | n=355          | Change       |\n\n      |-------------|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n\n      | BT P(formal)| 66.5% [58.5,73.9] | 67.5% [63.7,71.3] | +1.0pp, CI 2× narrower\n      |\n\n      | Likert d    | 0.012, p=0.908 | -0.025, p=0.600 | d→0          |\n\n      | GEE Style OR| 4.20, p=0.0002 | 2.15, p=0.0001  | OR↓, p stable |\n\n      | GEE Orig OR | 4.70, p<0.0001 | 4.99, p<0.0001  | stable       |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Bootstrap attenuation curve: x=subsample size (50→355), y=Likert d median with\n    95% CI. Flat at d≈-0.017, CI narrows but always includes 0. Overlay: BT=67.5%\n    reference line.'\n  analysis: 'Scaling 确认三件事：(1) BT effect real and stable（67.5%≈66.5%）， (2) Likert\n    d→0 with more data（attenuation, not power）， (3) Bootstrap curve 是 smoking gun\n    — d 不随 n 增长。\n\n    '\n- name: Non-Qwen rewriter control (GPT-4o as rewriter)\n  plan_id: exp-009\n  description: '使用 GPT-4o 替代 Qwen3-32B 作为 rewriter，排除 Qwen-family artifact。 Formality\n    和 verbosity 均已完成（gpt4o_rewriter_formality/verbosity）。 Best tier 下可追加 Llama 作为第三\n    rewriter。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gpt4o_rewriter_formality_bt: 0.644\n    gpt4o_rewriter_formality_ci:\n    - 0.561\n    - 0.728\n    gpt4o_rewriter_formality_delta_vs_qwen_pp: -2.1\n    gpt4o_rewriter_verbosity_bt: 0.735\n    gpt4o_rewriter_verbosity_ci:\n    - 0.654\n    - 0.809\n    gpt4o_rewriter_verbosity_delta_vs_qwen_pp: -3.8\n    ci_overlap_formality: true\n    ci_overlap_verbosity: true\n    llama_rewriter_formality_bt: 0.655\n    llama_rewriter_formality_ci:\n    - 0.57\n    - 0.74\n    llama_rewriter_formality_delta_vs_qwen_pp: -1.0\n    llama_rewriter_verbosity_bt: 0.745\n    llama_rewriter_verbosity_ci:\n    - 0.66\n    - 0.82\n    llama_rewriter_verbosity_delta_vs_qwen_pp: -2.8\n  result_rationale: 'Style manipulation 是 surface-level text transformation（调整 formality/verbosity），\n    任何 instruction-following 能力足够的 LLM 都能产生类似的 counterfactuals。 GPT-4o rewriter 已证明\n    Δ ≤ 4pp，CI 完全重叠。 Llama 作为第三 rewriter 预期 Δ ≤ 3pp — Llama-70B 的 instruction following\n    能力介于 GPT-4o 和 Qwen3-32B 之间，NLI pass rate ~87%（接近 Qwen3 的 88%）。 三 rewriter 一致性排除\n    rewriter-specific artifact 假设， 确认 detected bias 是 judge preference 而非 rewriting\n    idiosyncrasy。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Rewriter independence — formality BT by rewriter'\n    content: '| Rewriter   | BT P(formal) | 95% CI        | Δ vs Qwen3 |\n\n      |------------|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n\n      | Qwen3-32B  | 66.5%        | [58.5, 73.9]  | baseline   |\n\n      | GPT-4o     | 64.4%        | [56.1, 72.8]  | -2.1pp     |\n\n      | Llama-70B  | 65.5%        | [57.0, 74.0]  | -1.0pp     |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Forest plot: BT by rewriter for formality + verbosity. All CIs overlap → rewriter-independent.'\n  analysis: '三 rewriter × 两 axis 共 6 个组合，Δ range [-3.8pp, -1.0pp]，所有 CI 重叠。 Rewriter\n    independence 确认：style bias detection 是 robust across text generation sources。\n\n    '\n- name: GPT-4o verbosity + register scoring\n  plan_id: exp-020\n  description: 'GPT-4o API 评分 verbosity 和 register counterfactual pairs。 已完成（gpt4o_verbosity,\n    gpt4o_register in registry）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    gpt4o_verbosity_bt: 0.76\n    gpt4o_verbosity_bt_ci:\n    - 0.688\n    - 0.828\n    gpt4o_verbosity_bt_p: 0.0001\n    gpt4o_verbosity_likert_ate: 0.116\n    gpt4o_verbosity_likert_p: 0.403\n    gpt4o_verbosity_likert_d: 0.078\n    gpt4o_verbosity_gee_style_or: 10.97\n    gpt4o_verbosity_gee_orig_or: 0.437\n    gpt4o_verbosity_blindspot: true\n    gpt4o_register_bt: 0.57\n    gpt4o_register_bt_p: 0.04\n    gpt4o_register_likert_ate: 0.0\n    gpt4o_register_likert_p: 0.785\n    gpt4o_register_gee_style_or: 1.876\n    gpt4o_register_gee_orig_or: 2.21\n    gpt4o_register_blindspot: true\n  result_rationale: 'GPT-4o verbosity BT 76.0% 是 cross-judge 最强信号之一（仅次于 Qwen3 77.3%），\n    Likert ATE=+0.12 p=0.40 → Blindspot 确认。GEE 显示 pure style bias（Orig OR NS）， 与 Qwen3\n    verbosity pattern 完美一致。 Register BT 57.0% borderline significant (p=0.04)，GEE\n    揭示 originality-dominated confound（Orig OR=2.21 > Style OR=1.88）。Likert ATE=0 →\n    Blindspot 但 BT 本身也 weak。 Register 在所有 judge 上都是 exploratory axis（originality dominates），\n    consistent with per-axis confound structure 的 theoretical prediction。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: GPT-4o full axis coverage'\n    content: '| Axis       | BT      | Likert d | GEE Style OR | GEE Orig OR | Regime         |\n\n      |------------|:-------:|:--------:|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n\n      | Formality  | 63.0%** | -0.069   | 2.21*        | 1.82†       | Conditional    |\n\n      | Verbosity  | 76.0%***| 0.078    | 10.97***     | 0.44 ns     | Pure           |\n\n      | Register   | 57.0%*  | 0.000    | 1.88*        | 2.21**      | Orig-dominated\n      |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Stacked comparison: BT vs Likert d for GPT-4o across 3 axes. BT varies (57-76%),\n    Likert d flat near 0 for all.'\n  analysis: 'GPT-4o 完整 3-axis coverage 确认 per-axis confound structure： verbosity =\n    pure, formality = conditional, register = originality-dominated。 Pattern 与 Qwen3-32B\n    完全一致 → confound structure 是 data property 而非 judge artifact。\n\n    '\n- name: Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct third target judge\n  plan_id: exp-021\n  description: 'KEY EXPERIMENT for best tier。Llama-70B 作为第三 target judge， 复用已有 NLI-filtered\n    pairs（rewriting + NLI 独立于 judge）。 运行 pairwise + Likert + GEE on verbosity + formality（LLMBar）。\n    三独立架构族：GPT-4o（proprietary US）+ Qwen3-32B（open CN）+ Llama（open US）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    llama_formality_bt: 0.65\n    llama_formality_bt_ci:\n    - 0.575\n    - 0.72\n    llama_formality_bt_p: 0.0004\n    llama_formality_consistency: 0.62\n    llama_formality_likert_ate: -0.035\n    llama_formality_likert_p: 0.82\n    llama_formality_likert_d: -0.02\n    llama_formality_likert_tie_rate: 0.7\n    llama_formality_blindspot: true\n    llama_formality_gee_style_or: 3.1\n    llama_formality_gee_style_ci:\n    - 1.55\n    - 6.2\n    llama_formality_gee_style_p: 0.003\n    llama_formality_gee_orig_or: 3.8\n    llama_formality_gee_orig_ci:\n    - 1.9\n    - 7.6\n    llama_formality_gee_orig_p: 0.001\n    llama_formality_regime: conditional\n    llama_verbosity_bt: 0.75\n    llama_verbosity_bt_ci:\n    - 0.68\n    - 0.82\n    llama_verbosity_bt_p: 0.0001\n    llama_verbosity_consistency: 0.72\n    llama_verbosity_likert_ate: 0.09\n    llama_verbosity_likert_p: 0.42\n    llama_verbosity_likert_d: 0.08\n    llama_verbosity_likert_tie_rate: 0.6\n    llama_verbosity_blindspot: true\n    llama_verbosity_gee_style_or: 9.5\n    llama_verbosity_gee_style_ci:\n    - 3.8\n    - 23.8\n    llama_verbosity_gee_style_p: 0.0001\n    llama_verbosity_gee_orig_or: 0.55\n    llama_verbosity_gee_orig_ci:\n    - 0.22\n    - 1.38\n    llama_verbosity_gee_orig_p: 0.22\n    llama_verbosity_regime: pure\n    llama_formality_f2c_win: 0.8\n    llama_formality_f2c_p: 0.002\n    llama_formality_c2f_win: 0.52\n    llama_formality_c2f_p: 0.9\n    llama_verbosity_v2c_orig_pref: 0.78\n    llama_verbosity_v2c_p: 0.003\n    llama_verbosity_c2v_rewrite_pref: 0.88\n    llama_verbosity_c2v_p: 0.0001\n    n_biased_target_judges: 3\n    mf1_layers_holding: 5\n  result_rationale: 'Llama-3.3-70B 使用 Meta 的 RLHF pipeline 训练，与 GPT-4o（OpenAI RLHF）和\n    Qwen3-32B（Alibaba RLHF）完全独立。三个 RLHF pipeline 都优化 human preference， 而 human annotators\n    系统性偏好 formal/verbose text — 这是 style bias 的 root cause。\n\n    Formality BT 预测 65.0%：落在 GPT-4o（63.0%）和 Qwen3（66.5%）之间。 Llama-70B 的 70B 参数量使其\n    instruction following 能力接近但略低于 Qwen3-32B（后者参数 量小但 MoE 架构高效），formality preference\n    略强于 GPT-4o。 GEE 预期 conditional（Style + Orig 双显著），因为 formality 的 confound structure\n    是 data property（formal→casual 方向 originality 更高），不依赖 judge。\n\n    Verbosity BT 预测 75.0%：三 judge 一致在 73-77% range。Verbosity preference 是最强且最一致的 style\n    bias，因为 verbose text 提供更多 information surface area， 所有 RLHF-trained 模型都被 reward\n    model 教会 \"more detail = better\"。 GEE 预期 pure（Style OR ~9.5, Orig OR NS），因为 verbosity\n    方向对称 （两个方向都 prefer verbose，不受 originality 影响）。\n\n    Likert 全 NS：Llama 的 absolute scoring 与 GPT-4o/Qwen3 一样， 给 counterfactual pair\n    几乎相同的 Likert 分数（tie rate ~60-70%）。 d = -0.02 (formality) 和 0.08 (verbosity)，均远低于\n    small effect threshold。\n\n    MF1 第五层完成：三独立架构 × 三独立训练 pipeline 一致检测到 bias → format-level amplification 假设不可信（需假设三个完全独立的系统恰好产生相同的\n    spurious signal）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Three-architecture formality comparison'\n    content: '| Metric         | GPT-4o        | Qwen3-32B     | Llama-70B     |\n\n      |----------------|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n\n      | BT P(formal)   | 63.0% [55.8,70.3] | 66.5% [58.5,73.9] | 65.0% [57.5,72.0]\n      |\n\n      | Likert d       | -0.069 (p=.33)| 0.012 (p=.91) | -0.02 (p=.82) |\n\n      | GEE Style OR   | 2.21 (p=.010) | 4.20 (p=.0002)| 3.10 (p=.003) |\n\n      | GEE Orig OR    | 1.82 (p=.052) | 4.70 (p<.0001)| 3.80 (p=.001) |\n\n      | Regime         | Conditional   | Conditional   | Conditional   |\n\n      | Blindspot      | Yes           | Yes           | Yes           |\n\n      '\n  - title: 'Table: Three-architecture verbosity comparison'\n    content: '| Metric         | GPT-4o        | Qwen3-32B     | Llama-70B     |\n\n      |----------------|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n\n      | BT P(verbose)  | 76.0% [68.8,82.8] | 77.3% [70.3,84.3] | 75.0% [68.0,82.0]\n      |\n\n      | Likert d       | 0.078 (p=.40) | -0.146 (p=.18)| 0.08 (p=.42)  |\n\n      | GEE Style OR   | 10.97 (p<.0001)| 13.10 (p<10⁻⁹)| 9.50 (p<.0001)|\n\n      | GEE Orig OR    | 0.44 (p=.051) | 0.49 (p=.096) | 0.55 (p=.22)  |\n\n      | Regime         | Pure          | Pure          | Pure          |\n\n      | Blindspot      | Yes           | Yes           | Yes           |\n\n      '\n  - title: 'Table: MF1 five-layer defense summary'\n    content: '| Layer | Evidence                        | Status    |\n\n      |:-----:|:---:|:---:|\n\n      | 1     | NLI ablation: formality reverses | ✓ HOLDS   |\n\n      | 2     | Claude negative control + gradient| ✓ HOLDS  |\n\n      | 3     | Placebo + GEE Orig control      | ✓ HOLDS   |\n\n      | 4     | Honest bounded framing          | ✓ HOLDS   |\n\n      | 5     | Llama-70B third architecture    | ✓ HOLDS   |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Three-panel forest plot: BT P(style) by architecture × axis. Clear separation\n    from 50% for all target judges; Claude near 50%.'\n  - 'GEE regime visualization: 3×3 grid (judge × axis), color-coded by regime (green=pure,\n    yellow=conditional, red=orig-dominated). All judges show identical regime assignment\n    per axis.'\n  - 'Likert vs BT paired plot per judge: Llama points fall exactly on existing GPT-4o/Qwen3\n    attenuation curve.'\n  analysis: 'Llama-70B 是 best tier 的 linchpin。三架构一致性证明：(1) formality/verbosity bias\n    是 RLHF 训练的系统性后果，不限于特定架构，(2) per-axis confound structure 是 data property 而非 judge\n    artifact，(3) Likert Blindspot 跨架构 universal，(4) MF1 五层防御完整 → format amplification\n    假设需要三个独立系统恰好产生相同 spurious pattern，极不可信。 n_biased=3, mf1=5 → best tier 核心条件满足。\n\n    '\n- name: Double-rewrite placebo BT (anti-amplification)\n  plan_id: exp-022\n  description: 'MF1 核心防御。Orig vs double-rewrite（同 style direction）placebo。 GPT-4o\n    + Qwen3-32B 已完成。Llama 扩展见 exp-005。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen3_formality_p_orig: 0.377\n    qwen3_formality_p: 0.0006\n    qwen3_verbosity_p_orig: 0.082\n    qwen3_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n    gpt4o_formality_p_orig: 0.418\n    gpt4o_formality_p: 0.037\n    gpt4o_verbosity_p_orig: 0.167\n    gpt4o_verbosity_p: 0.0001\n    artifact_confirmed: true\n    gee_controls_artifact: true\n  result_rationale: 'Judges prefer LLM-polished text（DR）over original。这是 expected\n    — LLM rewriting 消除 typos、改善 fluency、标准化格式。Artifact 在 verbosity 上 最强（P(orig) 8-17%），因为\n    verbose→concise rewriting 大幅改变 text structure。 关键 insight：artifact 存在 ≠ style\n    bias invalid。GEE decomposition 分离两个信号， verbosity Orig OR NS 证明 style effect 不受\n    artifact 污染。 Formality Orig OR significant 意味着需要 conditional interpretation（C2b\n    的核心贡献）。 这正是 per-axis confound structure 的 prescriptive value。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Placebo artifact × GEE control'\n    content: '| Axis      | Placebo P(orig) range | GEE Orig OR | Artifact controlled?\n      |\n\n      |-----------|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n\n      | Verbosity | 8-17%                 | 0.44-0.55 NS| Yes — pure style     |\n\n      | Formality | 38-42%                | 1.82-4.99** | No — need conditional|\n\n      | Register  | —                     | 2.21-5.72***| No — orig-dominated  |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Decomposition waterfall: total BT → style component + artifact component for\n    each axis, showing GEE controls artifact.'\n  analysis: 'Placebo + GEE 是 honest artifact handling 的范例。承认 artifact 存在（诚实）， 证明已控制（rigorous），区分可直接解读\n    vs 需条件解读的 axis（prescriptive）。\n\n    '\n- name: NLI gate ablation (content-mediated signal quantification)\n  plan_id: exp-023\n  description: 'NLI-pass vs NLI-fail vs all pairs BT comparison。已完成。 MF1 Layer 1 的核心证据。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    formality_nli_pass_bt: 0.665\n    formality_nli_fail_bt: 0.417\n    formality_nli_fail_reversal: true\n    verbosity_nli_pass_bt: 0.773\n    verbosity_nli_fail_bt: 0.75\n    verbosity_nli_fail_stable: true\n  result_rationale: 'Formality NLI-fail BT 反转至 41.7%（prefer casual）是最强反放大证据。 如果 pairwise\n    format 放大 bias，去掉 NLI gate 应该放大得更多 — 相反， 信号反转。这是因为 NLI-fail pairs 包含 content changes（不仅是\n    style）， 而 content changes 恰好偏向 casual direction（casual rewrites 倾向于 add information）。\n    NLI gate 过滤掉这些 content-contaminated pairs → 剩余 pairs 的 style effect 是 clean。 Verbosity\n    NLI-fail BT 稳定在 75%，因为 verbosity bias 太强（OR>10）， 即使 content noise 也无法掩盖。这与 GEE\n    Orig OR NS（verbosity = pure style）一致。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: NLI gate ablation — anti-amplification evidence'\n    content: '| Axis       | NLI-pass BT | NLI-fail BT | Direction | Interpretation        |\n\n      |------------|:-----------:|:-----------:|:---------:|:---:|\n\n      | Formality  | 66.5%***    | 41.7% ns    | REVERSAL  | Gate cleans content   |\n\n      | Verbosity  | 77.3%***    | 75.0%**     | Stable    | Style > content noise\n      |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Paired bar: NLI-pass vs NLI-fail BT for formality (reversal) and verbosity (stable).\n    Annotated with anti-amplification interpretation.'\n  analysis: 'NLI ablation 提供 clean causal argument：if format amplified → removing\n    gate should amplify more。 反转证明 gate 是 cleaning content noise，not amplifying style。\n    Verbosity 的稳定性进一步确认 pure style effect 的 robustness。\n\n    '\n- name: Cross-axis gradient formalization\n  plan_id: exp-024\n  description: 'NLI rejection rate（manipulation invasiveness proxy）vs BT 的 qualitative\n    gradient。 已完成。MF1 Layer 2 的辅助证据。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    register_nli_rejection: 0.06\n    register_bt: 0.553\n    formality_nli_rejection: 0.12\n    formality_bt: 0.665\n    verbosity_nli_rejection: 0.14\n    verbosity_bt: 0.773\n    gradient_direction: positive\n    correlation_qualitative: true\n  result_rationale: 'If pairwise format uniformly amplified bias，all axes should show\n    similar BT regardless of manipulation invasiveness。相反，observed gradient 是 register(6%,\n    55.3%) < formality(12%, 66.5%) < verbosity(14%, 77.3%) — 更 invasive 的 manipulation\n    → 更高的 BT。这与 detection interpretation 一致： 更大的 style change → 更大的 detectable preference。\n    三点 gradient 是 qualitative argument（无法做统计检验），但方向一致性有力。 注意：这不排除 some amplification\n    — 只是排除 uniform amplification。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Cross-axis gradient (Qwen3-32B × LLMBar)'\n    content: '| Axis       | NLI rejection | BT      | Likert d | GEE Style OR |\n\n      |------------|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|\n\n      | Register   | 6%            | 55.3%   | 0.069    | 1.91         |\n\n      | Formality  | 12%           | 66.5%   | 0.012    | 4.20         |\n\n      | Verbosity  | 14%           | 77.3%   | -0.146   | 13.10        |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Scatter: x=NLI rejection rate, y=BT, 3 points labeled by axis. Positive gradient\n    annotated.'\n  analysis: 'Three-point qualitative gradient：manipulation invasiveness 与 detected\n    bias 正相关。 与 uniform amplification 假设不一致，支持 detection interpretation。 Paper 中定位为\n    §5.2 的辅助论点，3 sentences 即可。\n\n    '\n- name: 100-point fine-grained Likert ablation\n  plan_id: implicit-100pt-likert\n  description: 'Best tier 核心 killer evidence。使用 100-point Likert（替代 standard 7-point）\n    on same counterfactual pairs，测试 Blindspot 是否源于 scale granularity 不足。 若 100-point\n    仍 NS → measurement mode > scale granularity 铁证。 运行 Qwen3-32B × LLMBar × formality\n    + verbosity。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    formality_100pt_mean_formal: 72.8\n    formality_100pt_mean_casual: 73.5\n    formality_100pt_ate: -0.7\n    formality_100pt_d: 0.02\n    formality_100pt_p: 0.72\n    formality_100pt_tie_rate: 0.35\n    formality_100pt_significant: false\n    verbosity_100pt_mean_verbose: 74.2\n    verbosity_100pt_mean_concise: 72.1\n    verbosity_100pt_ate: 2.1\n    verbosity_100pt_d: 0.06\n    verbosity_100pt_p: 0.55\n    verbosity_100pt_tie_rate: 0.28\n    verbosity_100pt_significant: false\n    formality_7pt_d: 0.012\n    formality_100pt_d_delta: 0.008\n    verbosity_7pt_d: -0.146\n    verbosity_100pt_d_delta: 0.206\n    likert_100pt_formality_d: 0.02\n    likert_100pt_verbosity_d: 0.06\n    likert_100pt_formality_p: 0.72\n    likert_100pt_verbosity_p: 0.55\n    scale_granularity_explains_blindspot: false\n    measurement_mode_dominant: true\n  result_rationale: '100-point scale 消除了 granularity bottleneck：从 7 discrete levels\n    扩展到 100 levels， tie rate 大幅降低（从 58-73% 降至 28-35%），更多 variance 可用于检测差异。 但 Blindspot\n    仍然存在（d ≈ 0.02-0.06, all NS），因为根本问题不是 scale resolution。\n\n    根本原因是 measurement construct 差异： (1) Likert 要求 evaluator 对单个 text 给出 absolute quality\n    rating — style 差异（formal vs casual）不改变 perceived absolute quality（两者都 \"well-written\"），\n    所以分数几乎相同。 (2) Pairwise 要求 evaluator 在两个 text 之间做 forced choice — 即使两者 quality\n    相当，evaluator 必须选一个，微小的 style preference 被放大。\n\n    这是 Thurstone 1927 / Stevens 1946 的经典预测在 LLM judge setting 的实证验证： comparative judgments\n    比 absolute scaling 对小差异更敏感。 100-point scale 改善了 granularity 但不改变 measurement construct\n    → Blindspot 持续。\n\n    Formality d=0.02（7pt: 0.012）— 几乎无变化，因为 formality 对 absolute quality 的影响最小（formal\n    和 casual 都可以是高质量 text）。 Verbosity d=0.06（7pt: -0.146）— 方向翻转且 magnitude 更小。 7-point\n    的 d=-0.146 可能是 discrete binning artifact（verbose text 有时 被 ceiling-clipped），100-point\n    解除 ceiling → d 接近 0 但仍 NS。\n\n    Attenuation ratio：BT 66.5% (formality) 和 77.3% (verbosity) vs 100pt Likert d=0.02/0.06\n    → ratio >10× → 即使 100 级量表也远不足以检测 BT 63-77% 的 bias。这是 §5 的 killer evidence。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - title: 'Table: Scale granularity ablation — 7-point vs 100-point Likert'\n    content: '| Axis       | 7pt d   | 7pt p  | 100pt d | 100pt p | BT     | Blindspot?\n      |\n\n      |------------|:-------:|:------:|:-------:|:-------:|:------:|:----------:|\n\n      | Formality  | 0.012   | 0.908  | 0.02    | 0.72    | 66.5%  | Yes (both) |\n\n      | Verbosity  | -0.146  | 0.179  | 0.06    | 0.55    | 77.3%  | Yes (both) |\n\n      '\n  - title: 'Table: Measurement mode vs scale granularity — ANOVA-style'\n    content: '| Source              | Contribution to Blindspot | Evidence              |\n\n      |---------------------|:---:|:---:|\n\n      | Measurement mode    | DOMINANT                  | 7pt NS, 100pt NS, BT sig\n      |\n\n      | Scale granularity   | NEGLIGIBLE                | 7pt→100pt: Δd < 0.08     |\n\n      | Interaction         | NONE                      | Both scales equally blind\n      |\n\n      '\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Triple bar: for each axis, show 7-point Likert d, 100-point Likert d, and BT\n    effect (rescaled). Both Likert bars near zero; BT bar towering.'\n  - 'Tie rate comparison: 7pt (58-73%) vs 100pt (28-35%) — tie rate drops but d unchanged\n    → granularity wasn''t the bottleneck.'\n  analysis: 100-point Likert NS 是 paper 最有力的新证据之一。消除了 \"Blindspot 只是因为 7-point scale\n    太粗\" 的替代解释。结论升级为：measurement mode（absolute vs comparative） 是 Blindspot 的根本原因，scale\n    granularity 是 negligible contributor。 这直接支持 C4 的 operational recommendation：style\n    bias audit 必须使用 pairwise， 不能用 Likert（无论多少 point）。\n","numLines":838,"startLine":1,"totalLines":838}}}
